# control whose size (and the rest of both structures) is stack garbage; virtio-media then takes size as a payload to
# copy and fails with EINVAL, so GStreamer cannot set an encoder's profile. Sent upstream 23 Sep 2026:
# https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260923160936.33445-1-nick@getfieldwork.ai/
